    [CI] Route A2 single-card PR E2E tests to the B1/B3 mixed runner pool (#19168)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Switch the `a2-1` partition from `linux-aarch64-a2b3-1` to
    `linux-aarch64-a2b1b3-1-hk-001`, allowing PR single-card A2 E2E tests to
    use both B1 and B3 resources.
    
    Register the new label in runner metadata and the actionlint allowlist,
    and update the routing documentation. Existing test partitions, images,
    and cache targets are preserved.
    
    The shared routing also applies when these tests run through `/e2e`,
    Daily full-suite tests, or coverage workflows. Nightly routing is
    unchanged.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
